connector spec outline, version 1
summary: Reads, writes, and admin operations of an Outline wiki.
endpoint: base path none, hosts: any host of the catalog
auth: bearer, key variable OUTLINE_API_KEY
limits: timeout 30s (cap), reply 10485760 bytes (cap), at most 20 pages (cap)
operations: 166
1. outline.collections.list: read, POST /api/collections.list, writes no, cli on, mcp on
   list the collections of the Outline wiki
2. outline.collections.info: read, POST /api/collections.info, writes no, cli on, mcp on
   show the ID and name of one Outline collection
3. outline.collections.documents: read, POST /api/collections.documents, writes no, cli on, mcp on
